From 179b36e90d3226026a89e0724c604e34ad772ac8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: WGS Extract AI <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 12:51:39 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] run --dry_run=true prints its stages as commands
 (wgsextract #647)

Like run_deepvariant --dry_run, so a caller can run and resume
make_examples, call_variants and postprocess_variants one at a time.
postprocess_variants takes comma-separated --infile specs (no merged
CVO copy), fails on a missing CVO file instead of skipping it, and,
without --sample_name, names the sample from the CVOs' call set as
upstream does. The staged commands give the same VCF as run.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
